                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.512/1101: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-02-27T18:00:00-05:00">February 27, 1931—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>70. Your 83, February 24, 4 p.m., paragraph 3. Department perceives no objection
                    to proposed agreement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
